            <div xml:id="d508">

                <pb facs="0550" n="384" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg384"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 837.00/1227</note>
                <head ana="#head_untitled-inferred-from-preceding-sibling-head">[Untitled]</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Habana</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-03-16T01:00:00-05:29">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 16, 1917—1 a.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your March 14, 6 p.m. The President has answered <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Montana</hi> asking object of formal armistice. He has no information as to
                    need for formal declaration, but states a practical armistice already exists, as
                    he is making no advance toward Guantanamo.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Gonzales</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
